What is the output of the following cross-instance private field access program?
```java
class AccountSnapshot {
    private int balance;
    AccountSnapshot(int b) {
        this.balance = b;
    }
    int compare(AccountSnapshot other) {
        return this.balance - other.balance;
    }
}
public class SnapshotMain {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        AccountSnapshot a1 = new AccountSnapshot(100);
        AccountSnapshot a2 = new AccountSnapshot(40);
        System.out.println(a1.compare(a2));
    }
}
```

