What is the output of the following defensive copying demonstration?
```java
class SafeRange {
    private int[] bounds;
    SafeRange(int[] b) {
        this.bounds = new int[]{b[0], b[1]};
    }
    int getLower() {
        return bounds[0];
    }
}
public class RangeMain {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        int[] raw = {5, 20};
        SafeRange sr = new SafeRange(raw);
        raw[0] = 99;
        System.out.println(sr.getLower());
    }
}
```

