What is the output of the following invariant validation setter program?
```java
class SpeedGovernor {
    private int speed = 0;
    public void setSpeed(int s) {
        if (s >= 0 && s <= 80) {
            this.speed = s;
        }
    }
    public int getSpeed() {
        return speed;
    }
}
public class GovernorApp {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        SpeedGovernor gov = new SpeedGovernor();
        gov.setSpeed(50);
        gov.setSpeed(120);
        System.out.println(gov.getSpeed());
    }
}
```

